                                                "sense_id": "d39ba65d-abdb-3517-b1b6-5026e96250a2",
                                                "text": "In Spore the player guides a species from primordial monocellular ooze through the various stages of evolution: onto land, into tribes, civilizations and finally interstellar colonization."
                                            }
